<view class="page with-tab ai-page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="between" style="height:96rpx"><view><view class="top-title-main">AI 助手</view><view class="danger-text tiny">补充解释，不替代安全判断</view></view><view class="figma-menu"><image src="/assets/figma/all/s16-imgEllipse.svg"/><image src="/assets/figma/all/s16-imgEllipse.svg"/><image src="/assets/figma/all/s16-imgEllipse.svg"/></view></view>
<view class="notice notice-red" bindtap="danger"><image class="figma-icon md" src="/assets/figma/all/s16-imgEllipse1.svg"/><view class="grow">已经被咬或蜇、症状正在加重？</view><text>先进行安全判断</text></view>
<view class="section-title">你可以这样问</view><view class="suggestions"><view>帮我整理丽水徒步的行前重点</view><view class="danger-text">这条事件记录该注意哪些变化</view><view>如何区分常见蜱虫与蚂蟥</view></view>
<scroll-view class="chat" scroll-y scroll-into-view="bottom"><view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="index" class="bubble {{item.role}}"><view wx:if="{{item.role==='ai'}}" class="circle circle-green ai-avatar">AI</view><view class="bubble-text">{{item.text}}<view wx:if="{{item.role==='ai'}}" class="danger-text tiny" style="margin-top:14rpx">AI 生成内容，请结合危险信号判断</view></view></view><view id="bottom"></view></scroll-view>
<view class="record-picker"><image class="figma-icon sm figma-inline" src="/assets/figma/all/s16-imgEllipse4.svg"/>选择发送行程或事件摘要 <text>未选择任何记录</text></view><view class="composer"><input class="composer-input" value="{{input}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="输入你的问题…" confirm-type="send" bindconfirm="send"/><view class="send" bindtap="send"><image class="figma-icon md" src="/assets/figma/all/s16-imgEllipse5.svg"/></view></view></view>
